# Bloodmoon "An Island to the North": rumors of Solstheim lead the player to
# the Imperial outpost of Fort Frostmoth, where a guard greets the newcomer.
# Position stands in for the boat from Khuul; ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's
# slot 05 and Bloodmoon.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_c3_azura
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Any Imperial outside the beginners' town passes on the rumor, and asked
# about Solstheim, tells of the fort and the boat from Khuul.
case bm_rumors
run
player->PositionCell 504 330 -115 0 "Balmora, Clagius Clanler: Outfitter"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Clagius Clanler: Outfitter" == 1
talk clagius clanler
ask latest rumors
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Rumors == 10
ask Solstheim
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Rumors == 50
bye
run
player->Position -173771 143037 908 0
until 600 "vilbia herennia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk vilbia herennia
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Rumors == 100
bye
end
